# Degree in s of Q along the moving-subset curves C_1 (mask 1 in first place) and C_3, N = 6 and 7.
# Branch orders of W^2 are -115 (N = 6) and -198 (N = 7), so E = those and all e_i = 0; DB = deg_z Q + 10.
sdeg 6 190 115 100000 500 0 0 0 0 0 0 2 3/7 -5/3 11/4 -1 7/2
sdeg 6 190 115 111000 500 0 0 0 0 0 0 2 3/7 -5/3 11/4 -1 7/2
sdeg 7 430 198 1000000 500 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 2 3/7 -5/3 11/4 -1 7/2 -13/5
sdeg 7 430 198 1110000 500 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 2 3/7 -5/3 11/4 -1 7/2 -13/5
